# Build output.
build/

# The WDK headers, libs and tools, fetched from NuGet by fetch-wdk.ps1.
# Hundreds of megabytes of Microsoft redistributables have no business in a
# source tree; the script reproduces them exactly.
vendor/

# Generated from ../emulator/lib/hid-descriptors.js at build time. Not
# committed: a checked-in copy of a report descriptor is a second source of
# truth, and the failure mode is a device that enumerates and behaves subtly
# wrong rather than one that fails to build.
src/descriptors.h

# Test-signing certificate, created by sign.ps1 -Mode Test. Machine-local by
# definition, and a trust anchor - not something to share.
*.cer
*.pfx
